WEBVTT

00:00:00.640 --> 00:00:03.600
I'm gonna be the first-star idol one day!

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:07.690
Nijino Yume's about to start her Aikatsu!

00:00:10.570 --> 00:00:11.780
It's bamboo!

00:00:11.780 --> 00:00:14.570
That's right, it's just about Tanabata.{is this their summer uniform? did it just change?}

00:00:14.570 --> 00:00:16.160
Yes!

00:00:16.160 --> 00:00:19.540
Putting your wishes into words is yet another way to self-produce.

00:00:19.540 --> 00:00:24.830
Having all your wishes hung up around us will make for a beautiful Tanabata!

00:00:25.170 --> 00:00:28.380
Our wishes come together to make Tanabata beautiful?

00:00:28.380 --> 00:00:29.670
How wonderful!

00:00:29.670 --> 00:00:31.340
Let's write ours now!

00:00:32.670 --> 00:00:37.100
Done! My dream is none other than to become a member of S4!

00:00:37.760 --> 00:00:40.600
Mine is that I'm definitely going to get into S4.

00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:43.230
As for me...

00:00:45.980 --> 00:00:48.860
May I become more like Yozora-senpai.

00:00:55.740 --> 00:00:58.160
Each and every one of them is about Aikatsu.

00:00:58.160 --> 00:00:59.830
That's what you get from Four Star Academy.

00:01:10.630 --> 00:01:12.090
Who's that?

00:01:12.090 --> 00:01:15.090
Mahiru-chan. She's in Beauty Class with me.

00:01:15.090 --> 00:01:17.260
Yeah, I remember her well.

00:01:17.260 --> 00:01:21.970
She won the new student fashion show Grand Prix.

00:01:23.600 --> 00:01:24.890
H-Hey.

00:01:26.350 --> 00:01:28.310
Take a wish paper, Mahiru-chan.

00:01:32.820 --> 00:01:33.780
Who're you?

00:01:34.570 --> 00:01:36.820
G-Good question.

00:01:37.200 --> 00:01:39.120
I'm Nijino Yume, from Song Class.

00:01:39.120 --> 00:01:42.240
Koharu-chan told us all about you, Mahiru-chan.

00:01:42.790 --> 00:01:47.040
We're childhood friends. And this is Rola-chan, also in Song Class.

00:01:47.040 --> 00:01:48.170
Nice to meet you.

00:01:48.170 --> 00:01:51.090
We have a few pens to choose from. Which do you want? {yet they all use black}{sounds like a metaphor for... aikatsu?}

00:01:51.090 --> 00:01:53.590
None of them. I'm not writing one.

00:01:54.260 --> 00:01:55.970
Why not?

00:01:55.970 --> 00:01:59.050
I don't need silly pieces of paper.

00:01:59.050 --> 00:02:01.470
I'll make my wish come true on my own.

00:02:04.220 --> 00:02:06.180
S-So cool...

00:02:06.180 --> 00:02:08.480
Wow, now that gets me going.

00:02:12.520 --> 00:02:15.400
I wonder what Mahiru-chan's wish is.

00:03:52.620 --> 00:03:56.460
Koharu-chan, Yozora-senpai's show's started already.

00:03:56.460 --> 00:03:57.460
I know.

00:03:57.460 --> 00:04:01.220
Now, it's time for our advice corner.

00:04:01.220 --> 00:04:06.010
First, we have a letter from a girl in fifth grade.

00:04:06.720 --> 00:04:11.140
"My coords have been all been looking samey lately. What should I do?"{do real-juus really say samey}{d-don't they? they used to}

00:04:11.140 --> 00:04:13.730
Yeah, that happens to me all the time.

00:04:13.730 --> 00:04:14.980
Me too.

00:04:14.980 --> 00:04:17.060
What would you do, Yozora?

00:04:17.060 --> 00:04:21.740
Let's see... sometimes I flip through fashion magazines for ideas,

00:04:21.740 --> 00:04:24.410
but my favorite thing to do is walk around town.

00:04:24.410 --> 00:04:25.620
On a stroll?

00:04:25.620 --> 00:04:29.450
Exactly. Not only do I get to admire the scenery,

00:04:29.450 --> 00:04:32.620
but I can also people watch and window shop.

00:04:33.000 --> 00:04:37.960
Wandering around gives me the spark that lets me create novel Dress Makes.

00:04:38.880 --> 00:04:40.380
That makes sense!

00:04:40.840 --> 00:04:42.880
We'll end today with an announcement.

00:04:42.880 --> 00:04:47.550
We'll be holding a contest on this program for your dress ideas.

00:04:48.640 --> 00:04:53.480
The theme will be "Asian Heroine", the same as Romance Kiss's summer theme for this year.

00:04:53.480 --> 00:04:59.150
The student who designs the best dress will be be able to wear it for a special live.

00:04:59.150 --> 00:05:00.820
A special live!

00:05:00.820 --> 00:05:04.650
What is your ideal Asian heroine like?

00:05:04.650 --> 00:05:09.530
The winner will be chosen based solely on the quality of the coord, regardless of their year or class.

00:05:08.870 --> 00:05:13.410
{nobody needs to know what this says, it's just generic crap}

00:05:09.530 --> 00:05:13.410
I'll be on the panel of judges, 
along with the staff of Romance Kiss.

00:05:13.410 --> 00:05:17.250
We'll be waiting for your applications!

00:05:21.420 --> 00:05:23.920
We can't pass this one up!

00:05:23.920 --> 00:05:25.170
Yeah!

00:05:25.170 --> 00:05:28.180
All right, let's all enter together!

00:05:28.470 --> 00:05:29.800
Yeah!

00:05:33.850 --> 00:05:36.190
That girl's coord is so cute!

00:05:36.190 --> 00:05:40.400
It's just like Yozora-senpai said! 
Coming out to town was the right choice.

00:05:40.400 --> 00:05:42.530
Yume, you're acting like a creeper.

00:05:45.400 --> 00:05:47.570
It's about time for a snack. {ara, oyatsu no jikan da wa}{aku no hana, karen ni saku???}

00:05:48.240 --> 00:05:50.200
You're such a handful.

00:05:50.200 --> 00:05:52.120
Let's grab a bite to eat.

00:05:52.120 --> 00:05:53.700
I'm in!

00:06:01.210 --> 00:06:02.670
It's Mahiru-chan.

00:06:02.670 --> 00:06:04.340
I wonder what she's doing.

00:06:04.340 --> 00:06:07.630
So tell me, why exactly are we hiding?

00:06:07.630 --> 00:06:09.220
R-Reflex.

00:06:09.640 --> 00:06:12.930
What could she be doing in such a place?

00:06:12.930 --> 00:06:16.350
According to my deductions, she is deep in thought.

00:06:16.810 --> 00:06:19.810
"What flavor of muffin should I get today?"{I have detected an inferiority in your idiolect}{mine's more efficient, and thus superior}

00:06:19.810 --> 00:06:20.400
Huh?

00:06:20.400 --> 00:06:22.060
And she's decided!

00:06:22.060 --> 00:06:25.110
"Okay! A chocolate muffin it is!"

00:06:30.530 --> 00:06:32.240
One chocolate muffin, please.

00:06:33.620 --> 00:06:35.700
How did you figure that out?

00:06:37.910 --> 00:06:40.830
To the great detective Pinky Cat,

00:06:41.420 --> 00:06:43.500
no mystery is unsolvable!{is it weird that the literal and figurative meanings of とける line up with the literal and figurative meanings of "solve"?}

00:06:43.500 --> 00:06:44.880
Just kidding.

00:06:44.880 --> 00:06:46.460
Pinky Cat!

00:06:47.420 --> 00:06:48.760
Is this guy a detective?

00:06:48.760 --> 00:06:52.850
You don't know? He plays the protagonist of the detective drama Pinky Cat.

00:06:52.850 --> 00:06:54.600
He was even in the movie with us.

00:06:54.600 --> 00:06:56.020
Hello.

00:06:56.520 --> 00:06:58.180
I'm Kasumi Asahi.

00:06:58.180 --> 00:07:00.770
Nice to meet you, Nijino Yume-chan.

00:07:00.770 --> 00:07:03.520
Huh? How do you know my name?

00:07:03.520 --> 00:07:07.280
Subaru-kun's always talking about you.

00:07:07.280 --> 00:07:08.940
Subaru?

00:07:11.450 --> 00:07:14.280
Oh, the guy who keeps calling me "octopus".

00:07:18.370 --> 00:07:22.500
Subaru-kun was right about you! You're a really entertaining girl.

00:07:22.500 --> 00:07:26.420
Being called entertaining doesn't make me the least bit happy!

00:07:26.420 --> 00:07:30.760
Really? Subaru-kun hardly ever speaks that highly of others.

00:07:30.760 --> 00:07:33.430
I'm sure he meant it as a real compliment.

00:07:33.430 --> 00:07:35.600
I don't believe it.

00:07:35.600 --> 00:07:39.640
Anyway, how did you figure out what Mahiru-chan was thinking?

00:07:39.640 --> 00:07:41.390
Oh, that's because...

00:07:41.390 --> 00:07:42.850
They're siblings.

00:07:44.440 --> 00:07:45.770
Greetings.

00:07:45.770 --> 00:07:47.570
Yozora-senpai!

00:07:47.570 --> 00:07:48.900
Hey, Nee-san.

00:07:48.900 --> 00:07:52.070
"Nee-san"? And you said siblings... huh?

00:07:52.070 --> 00:07:54.030
Thank you for your patronage.

00:07:56.410 --> 00:08:00.580
My, what a coincidence for all three siblings to cross paths.

00:08:00.580 --> 00:08:02.710
Three siblings...

00:08:02.710 --> 00:08:03.670
I knew it.

00:08:03.670 --> 00:08:05.210
Huh? You did?

00:08:05.210 --> 00:08:08.090
I had a feeling since they had the same family name.

00:08:08.090 --> 00:08:12.090
We've all loved the muffins here since we were kids.

00:08:12.090 --> 00:08:14.550
We still come by once in a while.

00:08:14.550 --> 00:08:20.470
It's no mystery that as her brother, I knew that she liked muffins, and that her favorite kind was chocolate.

00:08:20.470 --> 00:08:21.930
Mahiru-chan!

00:08:21.930 --> 00:08:23.140
Back off!

00:08:23.140 --> 00:08:26.900
Onee-chan is so happy to have run into you in the middle of town!

00:08:26.900 --> 00:08:30.230
Your skin is so springy! I can't get enough! {I love it}

00:08:30.230 --> 00:08:31.990
S-Stop it!

00:08:31.990 --> 00:08:33.740
Everyone's staring.

00:08:33.740 --> 00:08:36.990
Gosh, you're too bashful.

00:08:36.990 --> 00:08:38.990
She never stops doting on her little sister.

00:08:38.990 --> 00:08:39.990
O-Oh...

00:08:39.990 --> 00:08:44.620
I know! Since we're here and all, 
why don't we have a cup of tea together? {second time you did this}

00:08:44.620 --> 00:08:47.880
I refuse. I have other things to do.

00:08:47.880 --> 00:08:50.630
Come on, it'll just take a few minutes.

00:08:54.680 --> 00:08:55.760
Tiles?

00:09:01.890 --> 00:09:03.520
I refuse.

00:09:04.890 --> 00:09:07.150
Are you sure? That's too bad.

00:09:07.150 --> 00:09:08.650
Goodbye.

00:09:09.190 --> 00:09:11.030
Mahiru's a karate expert.

00:09:11.440 --> 00:09:13.360
She smashes tiles when she gets angry.

00:09:15.860 --> 00:09:18.740
Nee-san, isn't it about time for your next gig?

00:09:19.580 --> 00:09:21.040
Thanks for reminding me.

00:09:21.040 --> 00:09:24.710
Here, a muffin I got for you as a refreshment. {this word always screws me up}{I usually don't like "refreshment" but since this time it has to same...}

00:09:25.540 --> 00:09:27.790
Thanks so much, Asahi!

00:09:27.790 --> 00:09:28.880
Excuse me!

00:09:29.540 --> 00:09:34.300
Yozora-senpai, we're all entering the stage dress contest.

00:09:35.630 --> 00:09:37.800
I'm excited to see your entries.

00:09:39.390 --> 00:09:41.810
Mahiru-chan's family is really impressive.

00:09:41.810 --> 00:09:45.770
Yeah, her father is the CEO of an apparel company.

00:09:45.770 --> 00:09:49.480
Her mother is a world-renowned supermodel.

00:09:49.480 --> 00:09:53.610
Her sister Yozora-senpai is a model famous across Japan,

00:09:53.610 --> 00:09:57.820
and her brother Asahi-kun is a member of the popular group M4.

00:09:57.820 --> 00:10:00.530
The Kasumi family is too amazing.

00:10:00.530 --> 00:10:06.620
But it gets me going! With a family so ingrained into the industry, she must be able to get advice about anything Aikatsu.

00:10:06.620 --> 00:10:08.960
That's what I thought at first too.

00:10:08.960 --> 00:10:12.210
But Mahiru-chan doesn't seem happy about it.

00:10:12.210 --> 00:10:14.090
Huh? Why not?

00:10:15.420 --> 00:10:17.470
Even though they're both in Beauty Class,

00:10:19.090 --> 00:10:24.180
I've almost never seen Mahiru-chan actually talk to Yozora-senpai.

00:10:24.180 --> 00:10:28.270
That's probably why some girls still don't realize they're sisters.

00:10:28.270 --> 00:10:31.230
It's almost like she's avoiding her sister.

00:10:34.150 --> 00:10:35.690
I wonder why.

00:10:36.440 --> 00:10:38.570
It's kind of hard to ask.

00:10:38.570 --> 00:10:41.120
I guess sisters come with their own baggage.

00:11:03.600 --> 00:11:06.430
It's Yozora's Fashion Time. {this is the full title}{yes, don't forget it}

00:11:08.100 --> 00:11:12.310
We got some many great dress ideas, and each one is a work of art in itself.

00:11:12.310 --> 00:11:15.770
A big thank you to everyone who submitted.

00:11:15.770 --> 00:11:21.030
We're going to announce which dress we found the best now.

00:11:21.610 --> 00:11:22.910
It's time.

00:11:22.910 --> 00:11:23.700
Yeah.

00:11:23.700 --> 00:11:25.530
Please!

00:11:25.530 --> 00:11:30.040
The decision was unanimous. The best dress is...

00:11:30.620 --> 00:11:31.790
This!

00:11:31.790 --> 00:11:35.790
Ba-da-da-da-da...

00:11:36.050 --> 00:11:36.800
Bam!

00:11:36.840 --> 00:11:38.920
The Blaise Lotus coord. {blaze is written differently, but it could just be a mistake}{sounds legit}

00:11:38.920 --> 00:11:43.590
It's a new take on the Chinese dress that makes use of bright colors and a unique ruffle cut.{the standard english term for チャイナドレス is "qi pao" if you want to use that}

00:11:44.430 --> 00:11:48.600
The lotus flowers and purple color express pure sexiness.

00:11:49.310 --> 00:11:52.060
The lucky winner who created this dress is...

00:11:52.060 --> 00:11:53.230
Lunch-san!

00:11:54.190 --> 00:11:55.860
So we failed...

00:11:55.860 --> 00:11:56.900
Aw man...

00:11:56.900 --> 00:11:57.940
Yiss!

00:11:59.320 --> 00:12:00.650
Huh?

00:12:00.650 --> 00:12:02.070
Mahiru-chan?

00:12:03.780 --> 00:12:07.660
I'll be looking forward to meeting you in person, Lunch-san.

00:12:07.660 --> 00:12:09.080
Goodbye everyone.

00:12:09.080 --> 00:12:09.660
See you n—

00:12:11.250 --> 00:12:14.330
So you watch Yozora-senpai's show too, Mahiru-chan.

00:12:14.330 --> 00:12:16.460
Oh, did you enter the contest too?

00:12:16.460 --> 00:12:18.550
Uh, no, I...

00:12:18.550 --> 00:12:21.970
Could it be that you're actually Lunch-san?

00:12:22.880 --> 00:12:24.090
But why?

00:12:24.090 --> 00:12:27.640
"Lunch" kind of sounds like her name in English, so I had a feeling.

00:12:28.720 --> 00:12:30.470
So what if I am?

00:12:30.470 --> 00:12:32.180
That's awesome!

00:12:32.940 --> 00:12:35.980
It's no small feat to beat out this many applicants.

00:12:35.980 --> 00:12:38.480
I knew you were amazing, Mahiru-chan.

00:12:41.110 --> 00:12:44.490
But why did you enter with the name "Lunch"?

00:12:45.360 --> 00:12:48.490
I didn't want anybody to think I was chosen just because we're sisters.

00:12:48.910 --> 00:12:52.000
And I also wanted to issue her a challenge.{alright whatever}

00:12:52.000 --> 00:12:54.620
Challenge? Who?

00:12:56.710 --> 00:12:58.290
Kasumi Yozora.

00:13:00.420 --> 00:13:06.390
My sister's always been beautiful, intelligent, and perfect at everything.

00:13:07.140 --> 00:13:08.760
She even has a lot of friends.

00:13:10.560 --> 00:13:13.600
I can't match her in anything I do. {does that mean Yozora knows karate?}

00:13:13.600 --> 00:13:16.400
But that's why I don't want to lose!

00:13:21.690 --> 00:13:25.780
Mahiru-chan, I don't think you're losing to Yozora-senpai at all! You—

00:13:25.780 --> 00:13:26.780
Excuse me!

00:13:27.410 --> 00:13:29.030
But I want to train.

00:13:37.920 --> 00:13:38.960
<i>I won't lose.</i>

00:13:40.710 --> 00:13:41.960
<i>I don't ever</i>

00:13:42.840 --> 00:13:44.170
<i>want to lose!</i>

00:13:49.680 --> 00:13:50.640
Okay!

00:13:58.520 --> 00:13:59.690
My.

00:14:02.320 --> 00:14:03.730
I'm Lunch.

00:14:05.030 --> 00:14:07.070
So that was it.

00:14:07.070 --> 00:14:11.830
Come to think of it, we had nicknames for each other when we played together as children.

00:14:11.830 --> 00:14:17.080
Asahi was Morning, you were Lunch, and I was Dinner. {why is "night sky" dinner... also why isn't Asahi Breakfast}{because bangohan is not a good name for an idol}

00:14:17.920 --> 00:14:21.080
I show you what an unforgettable performance looks like.

00:14:22.290 --> 00:14:24.800
Sure, I have high hopes.

00:14:28.300 --> 00:14:30.220
<i>I'll surpass you!</i>

00:14:32.680 --> 00:14:33.470
Yes?

00:14:34.390 --> 00:14:36.430
Yoohoo, Mahiru-chan!{I'm so proud you of}

00:14:36.430 --> 00:14:38.730
Sorry for barging in right before you go on.

00:14:39.600 --> 00:14:40.980
Why are you here?

00:14:43.730 --> 00:14:45.480
This is for you!

00:14:45.480 --> 00:14:46.610
What is it?

00:14:46.610 --> 00:14:50.490
Refreshments! We baked a chocolate cake for you.

00:14:50.490 --> 00:14:52.070
Refreshments... {this is why it has to match earlier}

00:14:52.740 --> 00:14:53.740
Take it!

00:14:57.330 --> 00:14:58.580
Can I open it?

00:14:58.580 --> 00:14:59.670
Of course!

00:15:05.840 --> 00:15:08.090
The cake is a mess!

00:15:08.090 --> 00:15:09.680
It's because you ran here.

00:15:09.680 --> 00:15:13.390
But I was worried we'd miss her performance otherwise!

00:15:13.390 --> 00:15:17.890
Sorry. I drew your face on it, but it got all messed up.

00:15:17.890 --> 00:15:22.480
Don't worry, Yume-chan's family runs a 
confectionery shop, so it's sure to taste good.

00:15:22.480 --> 00:15:24.190
And that's all that really matters.

00:15:24.190 --> 00:15:26.440
It didn't really look like you anyway.

00:15:26.440 --> 00:15:29.820
Huh?! Tell me that sort of thing earlier!

00:15:35.330 --> 00:15:37.540
Your smile right now is really nice.

00:15:39.040 --> 00:15:40.290
My smile?

00:15:40.290 --> 00:15:42.920
Your mature demeanor is cool too,

00:15:42.920 --> 00:15:45.920
but I really love your smile.

00:15:47.750 --> 00:15:48.920
What's wrong?

00:15:49.800 --> 00:15:53.050
I feel like I'd been forgetting to smile.

00:16:03.600 --> 00:16:05.560
H-How is it?

00:16:07.610 --> 00:16:09.320
Delicious!

00:16:12.320 --> 00:16:14.780
Thank you for your patience.

00:16:14.780 --> 00:16:20.790
Lunch-san, also known as Kasumi Mahiru-san, 
will now perform in the winning dress she created.

00:16:20.790 --> 00:16:22.870
We'll begin in just a moment.

00:16:22.870 --> 00:16:24.670
Get excited!

00:16:34.640 --> 00:16:38.430
Kasumi Mahiru, like a radiant light.

00:19:39.280 --> 00:19:41.910
Mahiru-chan, you were amazing out there!

00:19:41.910 --> 00:19:43.450
You're the best!

00:19:43.450 --> 00:19:47.410
Seeing your smile brought a smile to my face too.

00:19:47.410 --> 00:19:49.000
Thanks.

00:19:49.000 --> 00:19:51.870
Lunch-san, thank you very much.

00:19:53.420 --> 00:19:55.920
Wasn't that a lovely performance?

00:19:55.920 --> 00:20:02.680
Not simply her dress, but her singing and dancing were all marvelous to behold.

00:20:02.680 --> 00:20:06.930
Kasumi Mahiru-san has a bright future ahead of her.

00:20:11.180 --> 00:20:12.940
She praised you through the roof!

00:20:12.940 --> 00:20:14.980
Isn't that great, Mahiru-chan?

00:20:16.900 --> 00:20:18.320
Mahiru-chan?

00:20:19.070 --> 00:20:20.820
It's always been like this.

00:20:20.820 --> 00:20:24.870
No matter how much I want to catch up or how desperately I run after her,

00:20:24.870 --> 00:20:30.080
she's always relaxed and smiling, just out of reach.

00:20:30.080 --> 00:20:33.500
That's exactly why you're so amazing yourself, Mahiru-chan.

00:20:33.500 --> 00:20:34.330
Huh?

00:20:34.330 --> 00:20:38.590
You just had this outstanding performance, yet you're not satisfied at all.

00:20:38.590 --> 00:20:43.590
That must be because you're constantly reminded of your lofty goal of reaching your sister. {fixed it}

00:20:43.590 --> 00:20:46.600
You'll keep on putting more effort into your Aikatsu, won't you?

00:20:47.600 --> 00:20:50.350
Of course. I won't lose to my sister.

00:20:50.350 --> 00:20:52.850
I'll surpass her one day.

00:20:52.850 --> 00:20:54.810
That's the spirit!

00:20:54.810 --> 00:20:57.400
So... Yume-san.

00:20:57.400 --> 00:20:59.610
Just call me Yume!

00:20:59.610 --> 00:21:03.360
Yume, mind if I put up a wish paper?

00:21:04.400 --> 00:21:08.910
